This license applies to all source code and build artifacts of the
DollanCustomized mod (Minecraft 1.12.2 / Cleanroom), whose official
mod_id is "dollancustomized".

————————————————————————————————————————
条款 / TERMS
————————————————————————————————————————

1. 源码可得（Source-Available）
   任何人可以查看、获取本模组源代码，用于学习、研究与审查。
   Anyone may view and obtain the source code of this mod for learning,
   research, and review purposes.

2. 禁止原样使用 / 分发（No Verbatim Use or Redistribution）
   不得以原封不动、仅重新打包、换壳或改名的形式复制、分发、发布
   本模组的源代码或编译产物（.jar 等）。任何使用本模组代码的衍生
   作品，都必须对源代码做出实质性的功能或逻辑修改。
   You may not copy, distribute, or publish the source code or compiled
   artifacts of this mod verbatim, repackaged, or rebranded. Any derived
   work that uses this mod's code must make substantive functional or
   logical modifications to the source code.

3. 衍生作品必须开源（Copyleft on Derivatives）
   任何基于本模组或其衍生作品必须以其源代码形式、并以与本条款
   相同或等效的限制性条款向第三方开放，不得闭源分发或提供仅二进制
   的衍生作品。
   Any derivative of this mod, or any work derived from it, must be made
   available in source form and under the same or equivalent restrictive
   terms as this license. Closed-source distribution of derivatives is
   prohibited.

4. 禁止使用原 mod_id（Forbidden to Reuse the Original mod_id）
   任何衍生作品必须更换 mod_id，不得继续使用官方 mod_id
   "dollancustomized"。强烈建议同时更换根包名
   "com.jhxiaochen.dollancustomized"，并修改 mod 名称，避免与原作者
   的发布物混淆或被误认为官方版本。
   Any derivative work MUST change the mod_id and MUST NOT keep the
   official mod_id "dollancustomized". It is strongly recommended to also
   change the root package "com.jhxiaochen.dollancustomized" and the mod
   display name, so as not to be confused with, or mistaken for, the
   original author's releases.

5. 保留署名（Attribution）
   任何衍生作品必须保留本版权声明、作者署名（jhxiaochen, HChanJ1689），
   并注明其来源为本模组。
   Any derivative work must retain this copyright notice, the author
   credit (jhxiaochen, HChanJ1689), and indicate that it is derived from
   this mod.

6. 免责声明（Disclaimer of Warranty）
   本模组按“原样”（AS-IS）提供，不附带任何明示或默示的担保，包括
   但不限于适销性、特定用途适用性及不侵权担保。在任何情况下，作者
   均不对因使用本模组而产生的任何索赔、损害或其他责任负责，无论该
   责任是基于合同、侵权或其他原因。
   The mod is provided "AS IS" without warranty of any kind, express or
   implied, including but not limited to the warranties of
   merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and
   non-infringement. In no event shall the authors be liable for any
   claim, damages, or other liability arising from the use of this mod,
   whether in an action of contract, tort, or otherwise.

